    "description": "* Architected and implemented an asynchronous event processing system utilizing Redis and Celery to handle live data ingestion while maintaining smooth site usability for users\n* Developed a custom FastAPI integration layer, enabling asynchronous data transfer from the main application to internal data analysis tool\n* Optimized system initialization performance by designing a local JSON cache layer and C++ Singleton pattern, in order to significantly reduce startup times and eliminate redundant file I/O on program launch\n* Collaborated to design and developed two full Django web apps from inception to product launch\n* Routinely led development on multiple features in development products\n* Assisted in the design of a 40+ table SQL database\n* Reduced user load times by implementing lazy loading for large DOMs using AJAX\n* Designed data structure to reduce a O(n^2) time and space solution to O(n) using a complex hashmap and an improved database querying\n* Used SciPy to compute and interpolate data for ThreeJs to visualize radar interactions\n* Worked with subject matter experts to design products for best customer experience\n* Trusted by team members to conduct MR/PR review due to propensity to find unexpected edge cases\n* Redesigned CI/CD pipeline shell scripts to import necessary python wheel files independent of system \n* Designed and developed multiple responsive webpage layouts utilizing Bootstrap to ensure consistency and usability across various screen resolutions",
